@petId = 1

### List pets
# Returns all pets, optionally filtered.
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets?limit=20
#~ &status=sold
Accept: application/json
#~ X-Debug: true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create pet
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rex",
  "tag": "dog"
}

### Get pet image
GET {{baseUrl}}/png/{{petId}}
